  "label": "Ernie as a Non-Threatening, Innocent Character",
  "description": "Ernie is a well-known, childlike, and non-threatening Muppet character from Sesame Street, typically associated with innocence, cheerfulness, and childlike curiosity. The meme exploits this perception by using his innocent appearance to contrast with the hateful message, thereby amplifying the shock and harm of the stereotype. This contrast is central to the meme’s intent.",
